      text: "The Seventh Sunday of Easter, between Ascension Thursday and Pentecost, drew its older name, Exaudi Sunday, from the opening word of this Introit. Its text takes in verses from Psalm 27, the same verses, \"tibi dixit cor meum, quaesivi vultum tuum,\" that form the entire text of this app's 2nd-Sunday-of-Lent Introit, here extended and brought to a close with the season's double Alleluia.",
      source: "chantblog, \"The Introit for the Seventh Sunday of Easter: Exaudi, Domine.\"",
